## solution

#### using two pointers

```cpp
bool linkedListCycle(Node* head) {
  Node* slow = head;
  Node* fast = head;
  while (fast != nullptr && fast->next != nullptr) {
    slow = slow->next;
    fast = fast->next->next;
    if (slow == fast) {
      return true;
    }
  }
  return false;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)
